{"version":1,"key":"card:257","content":{"id":257,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7c6c21b7-2722-4907-b277-6531c2bba7db","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"JavaScript 字符串内部使用 UTF-16 存储，即用 16 位的码元来表示字符。对于码点超出 BMP（U+FFFF）的字符，需要两个码元表示，也就是代理对。但早期的一批字符串 API（如 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"length"},{"type":"formatted","text":"、下标访问、"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"charAt"},{"type":"formatted","text":"）是按 UCS-2 的假设工作的，即把「一个 16 位码元」当作「一个字符」，因此会把这类字符识别为两个「字符」"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"aebf4352-4141-441a-a90a-0d619bff19e7","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"d0dc8082-94c0-4b8d-bec2-c7c63abc4c24","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 🤣 utf-16 -> 0xd83e 0xdd23\nconst str = \"🤣\";\n\nconsole.log(str.length); // 2\nstr.charCodeAt(0).toString(16); // d83e\nstr.charCodeAt(1).toString(16); // dd23\nfor (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {\n  console.log(str[i]); // � �\n}","collabId":"2ded9036-0d9b-4a64-a5f7-e085d08252bb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a9d2c578-f751-48fb-a1ff-0fce334683de","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"ES6 提供了更好的 Unicode 支持。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"codePointAt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以正确得到字符对应的 Unicode 码点"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"27f8af35-44b7-44f6-a773-dd6b5c6b48c4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"39a30106-2c4d-4cda-a5d0-8b580a030552","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const str = \"🤣\";\n\nstr.codePointAt(0).toString(16); // 1f923\nstr.codePointAt(1).toString(16); // dd23","collabId":"1fb492a3-9465-41b6-ada2-2dab4b0f1ce8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"callout","title":"信息","calloutType":"info","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","collabId":"437346e8-2177-40d9-8975-293491192866","children":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dd2bfe6e-bcf5-488b-8110-dc01458f18b5","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"codePointAt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的参数是"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"码元下标"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，不是「第几个字符」。"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"codePointAt(1)"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 落在低位代理 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"0xdd23"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 上，由于它不是代理对的起点，不会被合并，因此直接返回了它自身，这是符合预期的。"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"838f291b-c750-4b6a-a836-4fada7b2f358","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"与之相应的是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"String.fromCodePoint()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法，可以通过码点得到对应的字符"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9412c617-b63c-4120-b581-58ccbf4711d3","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"371bc268-186d-4210-ae93-06c23c8c5551","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const str = String.fromCodePoint(0x1f923);\nconsole.log(str); // 🤣","collabId":"e52606f4-9830-46da-b57e-f1c33c600b61","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2ead304b-63d5-4e94-ba84-3f8fa8575e60","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了兼容性的考虑，之前的行为没有修改，要正确的遍历字符串，ES6 提供了迭代器来遍历字符"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uui